      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kinross_Charter_Township%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Visitors can explore a one‑room schoolhouse built in 1902 and a log cabin from 1882, both preserved on the museum grounds.",
